{"step_index":778,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-08T23:12:03Z","input_tokens":2277,"cache_read_tokens":223666,"output_tokens":629,"content":"The changes have been implemented and verified:\n\n### Summary of Completed Changes\n\n1. **Auto Submissions Defaulted to OFF**:\n   - In [teacher.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html), `settingsState.autoRecordQuiz` is now initialized to `false` (toggle displays `OFF` by default).\n   - In Firestore `quizzes/active`, updated `settings.autoRecordQuiz` to `false`.\n\n2. **Clear Students Button & Confirmation Modal**:\n   - Added a **`Clear Students`** button in the Submissions dashboard header of [teacher.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html).\n   - Clicking it triggers a confirmation popup modal displaying the exact prompt:\n     > **\"Are you sure this is what you want?\"**\n   - Features **Yes** and **No** buttons:\n     - **No**: Dismisses the modal with no action.\n     - **Yes**: Deletes all student submissions from Firestore (`quizzes/{quizId}/submissions`) in batch.\n\n3. **Firestore Security Rules for Deletion**:\n   - In your Firestore rules, update `allow update, delete: if false;` to include `delete` so that the **Clear Students** button (and purging test submissions) has permission to delete:\n     ```\n     match /quizzes/{quizId}/submissions/{subId} {\n       allow read, create, delete: if true;\n       allow update: if false;\n     }\n     ```\n   - *(Once you apply this rule in Firebase Console, clicking \"Clear Students\" -> \"Yes\" will instantly wipe all test submissions from the database and screen).*\n\n4. **[HISTORY.md](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/HISTORY.md)**:\n   - Appended Non-Major Patch 1.0.17 per Rule 1.\n\n### Verification Results\n- **Modal Text & Buttons**: Verified exact text *\"Are you sure this is what you want?\"* with `#modal-yes-btn` (\"Yes\") and `#modal-no-btn` (\"No\").\n- **Default State**: Verified `autoRecordQuiz` is `false` in both code and Firestore.\n- **Script Validation**: Inline scripts in [teacher.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html) evaluated cleanly with 0 syntax errors.\n- **Rule 9 Zero-Comment Compliance**: Verified 0 comments or docstrings present in the codebase.\n- **Original File**: `QUIZ06 (1) (1).html` remains completely untouched per Rules 2 & 12."}
{"step_index":779,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-08T23:15:21Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\nupdated firestore ruels to\nrules_version = '2';\nservice cloud.firestore {\n  match /databases/{database}/documents {\n\n    match /quizzes/{quizId} {\n      allow read, write: if true;\n    }\n\n    match /quizzes/{quizId}/submissions/{subId} {\n      allow read, create, delete: if true;\n      allow update: if false;\n    }\n\n    match /{document=**} {\n      allow read, write: if false;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n\n\nalso popup modal, center to screen not at the bottom of the submissions\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-11-09T07:15:21+08:00.\n\nThe user's current state is as follows:\nOther open documents:\n- c:\\Users\\CxAdmin\\Desktop\\Exploit\\firebase-config.js (LANGUAGE_UNSPECIFIED)\n- c:\\Users\\CxAdmin\\Desktop\\Exploit\\index.html (LANGUAGE_UNSPECIFIED)\n- c:\\Users\\CxAdmin\\Desktop\\Exploit\\QUIZ06 (1) (1).html (LANGUAGE_UNSPECIFIED)\n- c:\\Users\\CxAdmin\\Desktop\\Exploit\\teacher.html (LANGUAGE_UNSPECIFIED)\n- c:\\Users\\CxAdmin\\Desktop\\Exploit\\vercel.json (LANGUAGE_UNSPECIFIED)\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
