{"step_index":787,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-08T23:15:51Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-09T07:15:51+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-09T07:15:55+08:00\nThe search for \"css fixed modal overlay center screen backdrop flexbox z-index\" returned the following summary:\nTo build a centered, fixed-screen modal overlay with a backdrop using **Flexbox** and proper **`z-index`** layering, use the structure and CSS pattern below[1][2].\n\n### HTML Structure\n```html\n<!-- The main modal overlay wrapper -->\n<div class=\"modal-overlay\">\n  <!-- The dialog box container centered via flexbox -->\n  <div class=\"modal-content\">\n    <h2>Modal Title</h2>\n    <p>This is a centered modal box using flexbox and a fixed backdrop.</p>\n    <button id=\"close-modal\">Close</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### CSS Styling\n```css\n/* 1. Backdrop / Overlay Container */\n.modal-overlay {\n  position: fixed;         /* Fixes it relative to the viewport */\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100vw;\n  height: 100vh;\n  \n  background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6); /* Semi-transparent backdrop */\n  \n  /* Flexbox centering magic */\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;     /* Centers vertically */\n  justify-content: center; /* Centers horizontally */\n  \n  /* Layering control */\n  z-index: 1000;           /* Ensures it sits above regular page content */\n  \n  /* Optional: handles scrolling if the modal is too tall */\n  overflow-y: auto; \n  padding: 1rem;\n}\n\n/* 2. Modal Dialog Box */\n.modal-content {\n  background-color: #ffffff;\n  padding: 2rem;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n  \n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 500px;        /* Responsive width */\n  position: relative;\n  \n  /* Ensures content stays interactive and accounts for stacking contexts */\n  z-index: 1001;           \n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Key Considerations for Flexbox & Z-Index Modals:\n\n1. **Avoid Stacking Context Pitfalls (`z-index` issues):**\n   If your modal box slips behind the backdrop or other page components[3][4], it is usually because a parent wrapper element in your HTML has a `position: relative/absolute/fixed` combined with its own `z-index`[3]. To comp\n<truncated 1011 bytes>\ngba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n   }\n   ```\n   *(Opened via JavaScript using `document.getElementById('myModal').showModal()`).*\n\nSources:\n[1] [stackoverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHOzl5XOz5MMlVrAKawMRctmBAOBXYlu9FIl_aK_jaKyLqvzCRvWbx5uLtyDYo94IERn_5Lx-9aQWamWD0NWDUDqZTqdPWAPUExqUm-VLu78uk5KsfQJ1ji2YsUDmfP-dqDnqpnosSlU8Q8NgUqQ-uPDKZ3lYqGmfoVSVknOptszs0=)\n[2] [tutorialspoint.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH9MvSAMdpktnMXshwPY4yb5_kA-4sjklGZoo_SKNBV_O6SJ_QuPMOUAXCNyvvQuEih-X1apDW64VSGe-g-uSzzuA1laX1gdqdnunxYOn-mR9BYEZG4xNp-hGQNBu8Pbak1q_hFBEqAJwkf_ZDly-hoXS_6NxfL04b84ln00SP6Npxvt_Xhc5sFwimfEaxPqGAumBVOjB0hkliULA==)\n[3] [unwiredlearning.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFzEn686l4L5QZQKdetOpJsLdNo_ofeyBxTJTHAbVP1qyaQZFlOCtn8pG02b2btiANPI25VuxnFQq-fYKnyvACBci-7IAZQI7LHI3U9USDOCuBQMf6otMqDKTUa9XLYbovs0TJZA1Pbxv3r)\n[4] [stackoverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGxMel-HZJsvdLArAa0CBIItpBbb6XQdpzZDX2z56PevdjUN93jZl4oXAYq_rrifLmjq1bqzlshWxbe6esuF3qSvRsF3P5Sevssm9F05z6veFsNy6S5xrjSs6tACedmevz7fJtI-wy78nh1JDSmzOYRYWVfDEd50LpxZwGUKBZWQnazFzjCK4tMhm72)\n[5] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHIzVtmhsaZQjKyltFNQEyQWNMk0d8kaxZeAlLWg8hu5Ecwu22v8omaPeOxWMpnAp0hXJEoMDxivyIybNoi9NTF5MRw21vKNBoPXGQNh3jGY1YBZqq0RK1Mi2UOcE-ZLJ-cJ98H)\n[6] [css-tricks.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHzTc_D0jWh_FHO-U-ag4F25kVst3xMxR4xVwnE_eQRvQtlYOkPXy4Ws6y5wHetE_kcjXjmp9JAPcCdKftLv6rmRpLI8nq2-3nIi3c6ojwK2GeOmpVxMYgNBz9sSFye6A83I8Mt3UF7Hf-IWxSxqQFNmbc=)\n[7] [mozilla.org](https://vertexaisear